<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 02:01:06 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>在威胁要用武力夺取格陵兰岛后，特朗普同意将其留给丹麦并加强军事存在。 “我们会非常保护它！”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/greenland-trump-denmark-control-us-military-presence/</link><description>丹麦和格陵兰政府仍需要议会采取行动才能执行。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26251526045694-e1789774973315.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 23:52:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/greenland-trump-denmark-control-us-military-presence/</guid></item><item><title>凯文·沃什刚刚透露了美联储的一项巨大变化。媒体错过了</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/kevin-warsh-federal-reserve-what-is-monetarism/</link><description>沃什正在准备以一种与几十年来完全不同的方式管理美联储。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2295625605-e1789764178549.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 20:45:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/kevin-warsh-federal-reserve-what-is-monetarism/</guid></item><item><title>“我现在意识到我很愚蠢”：早期 Roblox 程序员的遗孀据称被骗了 600 万美元，试图买断一名男子的应召合同</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/roblox-widow-lawsuit-escort-paid-6-million-contract/</link><description>一项诉讼称，一名男性应召女郎利用玛丽安·弗利波 (Marianne Flippo) 的悲痛和罕见疾病，骗取 595 万美元，以解除应召合同。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2259269081-e1789765726206.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 21:36:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/roblox-widow-lawsuit-escort-paid-6-million-contract/</guid></item><item><title>随着航空燃油价格飙升，美国航空、联合航空和西南航空都在削减“边缘航线”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/airlines-cut-least-profitable-flights-jet-fuel/</link><description>由于燃油激增，美国航空、联合航空和西南航空正在削减航班时刻表，而旅客的票价已经比一年前高出近四分之一&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2272201729-e1789764936143.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 21:04:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/airlines-cut-least-profitable-flights-jet-fuel/</guid></item><item><title>伊朗战争正在造就新的一日百万富翁：油轮勇敢地穿越霍尔木兹海峡</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/iran-war-minting-new-one-day-millionaires-oil-tankers-crossing-strait-of-hormuz-1-million-dollars-per-day/</link><description>由于保险费飙升和市场整合推高了运输成本，租用一艘油轮每天的成本首次超过 100 万美元。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2294254400-e1789763440160.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 20:58:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/iran-war-minting-new-one-day-millionaires-oil-tankers-crossing-strait-of-hormuz-1-million-dollars-per-day/</guid></item><item><title>“这是一个愚蠢的想法”：如果共和党赢得中期选举，共和党人将放弃拟议的“特朗普股息”5,000美元计划</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/republicans-split-trump-dividend-5000-midterms/</link><description>承诺的支票“只不过是重复的违背承诺”，而且经常被重复。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2294419035_a508c7-e1789761749121.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 20:07:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/republicans-split-trump-dividend-5000-midterms/</guid></item><item><title>“没有人知道这些交易中有什么”：出于对负担能力的担忧，特朗普将宣布新的医疗补助药品定价模式</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/trump-announce-medicaid-drug-price-affordability/</link><description>特朗普去年签署了“最惠国”政策，承诺美国支付最低的药品价格。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26260854036875-e1789761329912.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 20:02:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/trump-announce-medicaid-drug-price-affordability/</guid></item><item><title>尽管消费者还不愿意将购物交给机器人，但信用卡公司正在“争夺土地”来制定人工智能购物标准</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/mastercard-visa-ai-shopping-payment-land-grab/</link><description>持卡人可以设置支出限额，但在接受调查的时尚购物者中，只有 7% 的人会在未经批准的情况下让 AI 进行购买。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1236652862-e1789760596884.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 19:58:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/mastercard-visa-ai-shopping-payment-land-grab/</guid></item><item><title>西德尼·斯威尼 (Sydney Sweeney) 不仅仅出演有争议的广告。她帮助设计它们</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/sydney-sweeney-novig-viral-ads/</link><description>在病毒式广告活动推出之前，这位女演员成为了体育预测市场Novig的股权合伙人兼创意总监。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2295598439.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 18:28:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/sydney-sweeney-novig-viral-ads/</guid></item><item><title>Snap 斥 35 亿美元押注企业可以使用的 AR 眼镜，首席执行官埃文·斯皮格尔 (Evan Spiegel) 看到了后智能手机时代</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/snap-3-5-billion-ar-glasses-evan-spiegel/</link><description>Snap 首席执行官埃文·斯皮格尔 (Evan Spiegel) 表示，智能手机的时代即将结束，智能眼镜才是未来。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2295670303-e1789758749841.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 19:21:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/snap-3-5-billion-ar-glasses-evan-spiegel/</guid></item></channel></rss>